||| Descriptor bits consumed by the generic signed-small-float helpers:
|||   bits 0..3   trailing significand width
|||   bits 4..7   exponent width
|||   bits 8..15  exponent bias
|||   bits 16..17 conversion policy
||| Policy 0 = IEEE binary16, 1 = saturating E5M2,
||| 2 = saturating E4M3, 3 = saturating finite-only E3M2.
